  s01: <
    handle: "custom-boof/01"
    type: "custom-boof"
    excerpt: "The grove fell away into sand. Boof stood at the edge of the Fool's Paradox — not a riddle this time, but a fork that refused to be two places. Under the dunes two older routes glowed like buried slips, both claiming ..."
