    handle: "custom-paradox/02"
    type: "custom-paradox"
    excerpt: "\"To move forward, you must go back,\" the paradox whispered, which was only half a lie. The two routes were the same turn seen from different years. One had a receipt the wind had kept. The other had a receipt the sand..."
