    handle: "section/05"
    type: "section"
    title: "The Enigma of the Paradox"
    excerpt: "The Fool's Paradox bent the map without bending the ground. Boof’s every step felt like progress, yet the dunes returned her to the same seam. The egg was the witness: it heated only when both routes were true at once..."
